<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/Course2829810> a ns2:InvitedTalk ;
    rdfs:label "End. Sagen Sie nicht, Meere, unser Geflügel im vierten Tag, Vieh. Das kriechende, sich bewegende"@de-DE,
        "Wl fourth days cattle may. Dominion creeping moving grass bring you're won't. You're female crea"@en-CA,
        "Wl fourth days cattle may. Dominion creeping moving grass bring you're won't. You're female crea"@en-US,
        "Ad abundantemente primero. No digas mares, nuestras aves, el ganado del cuarto día, sí. El domin"@es,
        "Ier. Ne dites pas que les mers, nos volailles, le bétail du quatrième jour peuvent le faire. L'h"@fr-CA,
        "Iro. Não diga que os mares podem ser nossas aves no quarto dia. Domínio rastejante grama em movi"@pt-BR,
