<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/Grant6623806> a ns2:Grant ;
    rdfs:label "Ef sein, bis zum sechsten kommen und sagen: „Wird ni"@de-DE,
        ", under moved unto sixth saying won't. Female second"@en-CA,
        ", under moved unto sixth saying won't. Female second"@en-US,
