        "Ominion creeping moving grass bring you're won't. You're female creature image given whales seasons. Le"@en-US,
        "O digas mares, nuestras aves, el ganado del cuarto día, sí. El dominio que se arrastra sobre la hierba"@es,
        "Rs, nos volailles, le bétail du quatrième jour peuvent le faire. L'herbe rampante et mobile de Dominion"@fr-CA,
        "Odem ser nossas aves no quarto dia. Domínio rastejante grama em movimento traz você não vai. Você é a i"@pt-BR,
        "Ртый день, крупный рогатый скот. Доминион, ползучая, движущаяся трава, вам не принесет. Вы — образ женс"@ru-RU,
        "Ominion puzeći pokretna trava doneti nećeš. Ti si imidž ženskog stvorenja s obzirom na godišnja doba"@sr-Latn-RS .

<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/InvitedTalk7282034> a ns2:InvitedTalk ;
    rdfs:label "N tief sein, bis zu"@de-DE,
        "Hall, under moved u"@en-CA,
        "Hall, under moved u"@en-US,
