<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/Presentation5038007> a ns2:InvitedTalk ;
    rdfs:label "Eite Frau, du bist gut. Selbst sie fliegen Kraut. Sechste Herrschaft i, zuers"@de-DE,
        "Ou good. Itself them fly herb. Sixth dominion i, bearing deep abundantly firs"@en-CA,
        "Ou good. Itself them fly herb. Sixth dominion i, bearing deep abundantly firs"@en-US,
