    rdfs:label "Haft i, zuerst tief und reichlich tragend. Sagen Sie nicht, Meere, unser Geflü"@de-DE,
        "Undantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth days cattle may. Dominion cree"@en-CA,
        "Undantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth days cattle may. Dominion cree"@en-US,
        "A. Sexto dominio i, teniendo profundidad abundantemente primero. No digas mare"@es,
        "Tant profondément en abondance en premier. Ne dites pas que les mers, nos vola"@fr-CA,
        "Endo profundidade abundantemente primeiro. Não diga que os mares podem ser nos"@pt-BR,
        "Есущее глубоко и обильно. Не говорите морям, что наша птица четвертый день, к"@ru-RU,
        " izobilju. Nemojte reći mora naše živine četvrti dan stoka može. Dominion puz"@sr-Latn-RS ;
    ns4:BFO_0000055 <http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/person1823662>,
        <http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/person1904417>,
        <http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/person2946199>,
        <http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/person3128060>,
        <http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/person3550591>,
        <http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/person5882500>,
