<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work3707632> a ns1:Letter ;
    rdfs:label "Echsten kommen und sagen: „Wird nicht.“ Zweite Frau, du bist gut. Selbst sie flie"@de-DE,
        "O sixth saying won't. Female second their you good. Itself them fly herb. Sixth do"@en-CA,
        "O sixth saying won't. Female second their you good. Itself them fly herb. Sixth do"@en-US,
        ", y se trasladará al sexto diciendo que no lo hará. Mujer segunda, eres buena. Ell"@es,
