<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work5066293> a ns1:AcademicArticle ;
    rdfs:label " reichlich tragend. Sagen Sie nicht, Meere, unser Geflügel im vierten Tag, Vieh. Das kriech"@de-DE,
        "Aid seas our fowl fourth days cattle may. Dominion creeping moving grass bring you're won't"@en-CA,
        "Aid seas our fowl fourth days cattle may. Dominion creeping moving grass bring you're won't"@en-US,
